      "title": "GNSS: fix UBX-RXM-SFRBX byte swapping",
      "message": "GNSS: fix UBX-RXM-SFRBX byte swapping\n\nFix the UBX-RXM-SFRBX byte swapping of the navigation message for\nsubsequent dissectors to hand off to. Previous byte swapping was\nmangling the navigation message.\n",
